  "semanticGuards": [
    "All schemas strict;UUID/date-time formats checked by the implementation,not annotations alone.",
    "Canonical base64 decode/reencode equality;decoded size=minimum(32768,2012762-offset),offset exactly the requested one.",
    "Check sender pinned connection and phase on each callback;never accept frames from node outbox or a prior attempt.",
    "Task auth and company come from the DB join in contract.md,not any message field.",
    "already_present can skip source streaming;target FD is rechecked on authorized commit.",
    "source role ready.existing must be absent. Source/target observations and hashes are compared to the fixed policy;unknown actual values stay null.",
    "Node stored copied requires source/server/target checks;already_present requires current target size/hash. Server_complete is written only after pinned stored acknowledgment and receipt persistence.",
    "No JSONSchema file is itself a runtime grant;helper instructions come only from the authorized node adapter over fixed local pipes."
  ],
